You have the Orb of Weight and you don't have the Amulet.
Go whereever you like.  For example start at level 1 and
do a quick survey.  Once you've found your stash level(s)
and whatever the chances you'll remember the game goes up.
Once you've found your stash level(s) you'll know what
you have to work with.  One /oE with even one charge will
tell you your intrinsics, you may have a full set of
backups, you name it.  No need to use a wish until you
know the lay of the land, or even what level she's on
and if she's been cancelled yet. ;^)



